The Golden Spire is the seat of [[Org/Omnivox/index|Omnivox]], standing in orbit over [[Geography/Syrin (Locality)|Syrin]] in what was once Station 7, a television station that went dark and was built over. The whole station is the company's, and its main draw is a casino that admits the very wealthy.
